  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Measures to Prosecute Trafficking in Person (TIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute towards the government&apos;s coordinated efforts to combat TIP of men, women, and children in Indonesia by working with the Supreme Court to strengthen the judicial branch&apos;s capacity, especially at the district court level, to adjudicate TIP crimes in line with the TIP Law #21/2007 and properly apply victims of trafficking restitution and compensation claims.</narrative>
  </description>
